{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はいよいよ\n乃木坂46 5th Birthday LIVEと\nななみんの卒業ライブです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうこんな時期か〜(°_°)\n時が経つのは早いな〜(°_°)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぷに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/20/1945633/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/20/1945633/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達も着々と準備しております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみだけど緊張もするし\nななみん最後だし寂しいし\n色んな感情が入り混じってるヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今回の5th Birthday LIVEの会場は\n我ら埼玉民の誇り、\nたまアリ(さいたまスーパーアリーナ)です。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとここでライブがしたいと思っていたの！\n憧れの場所だったの！\nだからとっても嬉しいです☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーパーアリーナの外には\n色々な展示やパネル等が置かれているので\n記念に写真を撮ったり\nグッズをゲットしたりして\n早めに来て時間を有効に過ごすのもオススメです( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から来てくださる方\n楽しんで行ってください☺︎☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/20/1945633/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#chihaOOTD"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹が誕プレでくれたスリッパ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛くてあったかくてお気に入り♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/20/1945633/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くまちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この何ともいえない情けない顔が好き！\n目が見えてないのが特に可愛い..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほじくったら目出てくるんだよ！\nつぶらな瞳...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がこういうの好きなのを\nさすが妹、分かってる〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったです(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「せっかちなかたつむり」乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの声がまだ若くて\n初々しく感じる、可愛い曲。\n昔から可愛いなって思ってたの。\n一人一人のソロの声が好き。\n\"そうさりげなく 視線で合図して\nアプローチしても ちょっと鈍感みたい\"\nのところが好き！\nライブで披露するときのなーちゃんが\n可愛くていつも見ちゃう。\nBirthday LIVEは全曲だから\nこの曲も聞けると思うと\n私も嬉しいし、楽しみ☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/20/1945633/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"韓流ハート♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日でななみん最後...\n実感ないなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}